"List](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to get the "
"model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参考[支持特性列表](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)获取该模型的支持特性矩阵。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Feature Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get the"
" feature's configuration."
msgstr "请参考[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)获取特性的配置方法。"

msgid ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash model currently supports only model runner V1 on Ascend, so\n"
"all Atlas 800I A3 scripts set `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly."
msgstr ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash 目前在昇腾上仅支持 model runner V1，因此所有 Atlas 800I A3 脚本均显式设置 "
"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`。"

